      "Zürich HB 是機場、跨城鐵路、tram 與補給的交通門。Europaallee 在其西南側，適合抵達、離開與住宿基地。": "Zürich HB is the gateway for airport trains, intercity rail, trams, and supplies. Europaallee lies to its southwest and works well for arrivals, departures, and an overnight base.",
      "Old Town / 金融軸 (Financial Axis)": "Old Town / Financial Axis",
      "由 Bahnhofstrasse、Paradeplatz、Lindenhof、Grossmünster 與 Fraumünster 組成的緊湊步行核心；歷史、金融和河岸在這裡交匯。": "A compact walking core formed by Bahnhofstrasse, Paradeplatz, Lindenhof, Grossmünster, and Fraumünster, where history, finance, and the riverfront meet.",
      "大學山坡 (University Hill)": "University Hill",
      "ETH、University 和 Polyterrasse 位於 Old Town 東北側高地；適合用 Polybahn 上山看城市、湖和屋頂。": "ETH, the university, and Polyterrasse occupy high ground northeast of the Old Town. Take the Polybahn uphill for city, lake, and rooftop views.",
      "Bürkliplatz、Bellevue、Opera House 與 Seefeld 組成 Lake Zurich 的城市客廳；適合湖景、船班和輕鬆散步。": "Bürkliplatz, Bellevue, the Opera House, and Seefeld form Lake Zurich’s urban living room, ideal for lake views, boats, and an easy stroll.",
      "舊工業區轉型為設計、餐飲、Im Viadukt 與創意街區；適合獨立安排半日，不必接在抵達日主線後。": "A former industrial area transformed by design, dining, Im Viadukt, and creative businesses. Give it a separate half-day rather than adding it after the arrival-day route.",
      "交通核心｜機場 train、跨城鐵路、tram 與補給集中處": "Transport hub | airport trains, intercity rail, trams, and supplies",
      "H1｜已訂住宿｜Langstrasse 150，Europaallee / Langstrasse 一側；距 Zürich HB 約 9–12 分鐘步行": "H1 | Booked hotel | Langstrasse 150, on the Europaallee / Langstrasse side; about 9–12 minutes on foot from Zürich HB",
      "Old Town 的觀景高地｜俯瞰 Limmat River 與城市屋頂": "Old Town viewpoint | overlooks the Limmat and city rooftops",
      "Old Town 標誌性教堂｜宗教改革歷史": "Landmark Old Town church | Reformation history",
      "湖邊門戶｜船班、市場與 Bahnhofstrasse 南端": "Lakefront gateway | boats, markets, and the south end of Bahnhofstrasse",
      "湖邊 tram 樞紐｜連接 Old Town、Opera House 與 Zürichhorn": "Lakefront tram hub | connects the Old Town, Opera House, and Zürichhorn",
      "大學山坡｜由 Central 乘 Polybahn 上山": "University Hill | take the Polybahn uphill from Central",
      "HB 西南側新開發區｜餐飲、辦公與現代城市景觀": "New district southwest of HB | dining, offices, and modern cityscape",
      "Zürich West｜鐵路拱廊、設計店與餐飲": "Zürich West | railway arches, design shops, and dining",
      "慢早餐選 Babu’s；趕火車選 Zürich HB Sprüngli；蔬食或同行口味不同時選 Hiltl。": "Choose Babu’s for a slow breakfast, Zürich HB Sprüngli when catching a train, or Hiltl for vegetarian food and mixed preferences.",
      "傳統肉食選 Zeughauskeller，fondue／raclette 選 Swiss Chuchi，清爽蔬食選 Hiltl。": "Choose Zeughauskeller for traditional meat dishes, Swiss Chuchi for fondue / raclette, or Hiltl for lighter vegetarian food.",
      "8/15 City Walk 可選 Schwarzenbach 或 Schober；8/16 星期日以 Zürich HB Sprüngli 最穩妥。": "On the 8/15 city walk, choose Schwarzenbach or Schober. On Sunday 8/16, Zürich HB Sprüngli is the most reliable option.",
      "fondue 選 Swiss Chuchi 或 Le Dézaley；不想吃 cheese 可選 Hiltl 或 Zeughauskeller。": "For fondue, choose Swiss Chuchi or Le Dézaley. If you do not want cheese, choose Hiltl or Zeughauskeller.",
      "湖邊快速吃選 Sternen Grill；換城與行李日優先 Zürich HB Sprüngli。": "Choose Sternen Grill for a quick lakefront meal; on transfer or luggage days, prioritise Zürich HB Sprüngli.",
