    "Bern 行程模塊庫｜Switzerland–Germany 旅程": "Bern Trip Module Library | Switzerland–Germany Trip",
    "Bern 行程模塊庫": "Bern Trip Module Library",
    "Bern 行程模塊": "Bern Trip Module",
