    "以模塊所列起終點搜索，不鎖死單一班次；出發前再次檢查 platform、施工和替代交通。": "Search using the module's stated origin and destination without committing to one service; recheck the platform, engineering work, and replacement transport before departure.",
    "住朋友家不預設可取得 Bern-Ticket；按實際搭乘次數購買 Libero 票。 回程至少預留一班車的餘量，活動模塊另加 operator 延遲緩衝。": "Do not assume a Bern Ticket when staying with friends; buy Libero tickets according to the actual number of rides. Leave at least one later service as a return buffer, with extra allowance for operator delays on activity modules.",
