    "雷暴、結冰或連續強降雨時不要登塔或走陡坡；若只剩不足兩小時，改走 Bahnhof–Zytglogge 短線。 已購票也不應凌駕於現場安全和能見度判斷。": "Avoid towers and steep slopes during thunderstorms, ice, or persistent heavy rain. With less than two hours, use the short Bahnhof–Zytglogge route. A purchased ticket never overrides on-site safety or visibility judgements.",
