    "不需自行刻意繞去 Basel Bad Bf；按 app 顯示的完整路線和月台轉車即可。": "There is no need to make a deliberate detour through Basel Bad Bf; follow the full itinerary and platform information shown in the app.",
    "票券取捨：每人二等座": "Ticket options: second class per person",
    "｜可 exchange / refund。": "| exchangeable / refundable.",
    "｜可在條件下 exchange / refund。": "| exchangeable / refundable subject to conditions.",
    "｜不可 exchange、不可 refund，並綁定所選班次。": "| no exchanges or refunds; valid only on the selected service.",
    "兩人分別為 CHF 137.40／72／58；出票前確認": "For two people, the respective totals are CHF 137.40 / 72 / 58; before purchase, confirm",
    "本行程建議": "Recommendation for this trip",
    "8/20 是搬住宿日，優先直達 ICE；若出發時間仍可能受朋友家、退房或前一晚安排影響，選 Saver offer Flex 或 Regular offer，不為最便宜票而承擔錯過車次後重買票的風險。": "August 20 is a hotel-transfer day, so prioritise the direct ICE. If your departure time may still depend on leaving your friends’ home, check-out, or the previous evening’s plans, choose the Saver Offer Flex or Regular Offer rather than risk buying a new ticket after missing a fixed train.",
    "抵達後先放置大型行李，再走 Freiburg Old Town 短線；不安排完整 Schlossberg 山徑。車上仍帶護照，跨境列車可能抽查。": "Leave your large luggage after arrival, then take the short Freiburg Old Town route; do not attempt the full Schlossberg trail. Keep your passport with you because spot checks are possible on cross-border trains.",
    "Freiburg City Walk 地圖": "Freiburg city-walk map",
    "城市重點：城市歷史、Bächle 水渠、城市門、Black Forest 及 Green City 身份。": "City themes: local history, the Bächle channels, city gates, the Black Forest, and Freiburg’s Green City identity.",
    "交通安排": "Getting around",
    "Freiburg (Breisgau) Hbf → Martinstor 約 10–15 分鐘步行，適合作為抵達後的短轉移段。": "Freiburg (Breisgau) Hbf → Martinstor is a 10–15-minute walk, an easy first leg after arrival.",
    "Martinstor、Münsterplatz、Konviktstraße、Schwabentor 都在 Old Town 內，主線以步行即可完成。": "Martinstor, Münsterplatz, Konviktstraße, and Schwabentor are all within the Old Town; complete the main route on foot.",
    "Schwabentor → Schlossberg 只需短距離上坡；若體力不足，可將 Schlossberg 改為 Optional，乘 tram 到 Stadtgarten 再轉 Schlossbergbahn。": "Schwabentor → Schlossberg involves only a short uphill stretch. If energy is low, make Schlossberg optional and take a tram to Stadtgarten, then change to the Schlossbergbahn.",
    "完整 Schlossberg Panorama / Fortress route 不放在 8 月 20 日搬行李日；建議放到有完整半天的日子。": "Do not schedule the full Schlossberg Panorama / Fortress route on the August 20 luggage-transfer day; save it for a day with a full half-day available.",
    "Freiburg 周邊位置總覽": "Overview of the Freiburg Region",
    "以下地圖以 Freiburg 為中心，展示各個周邊選項的大致方向和距離關係。地圖上的連線只代表位置關係，不代表實際鐵路路線。": "Centred on Freiburg, this map shows the approximate direction and distance of each nearby option. The connecting lines show geographic relationships only, not actual rail routes.",
    "Freiburg 周邊景點位置總覽地圖": "Map overview of sights around Freiburg",
    "Freiburg 基地": "Freiburg base",
    "溫泉／主題樂園": "Spa / theme park",
    "跨境城市": "Cross-border city",
    "位置編號與下方卡片對應；點擊標記可查看該選項的主題。詳細交通請進入各自的 Full-day 頁面。": "Map numbers correspond to the cards below. Select a marker to see that option’s theme; open its full-day page for detailed transport.",
    "8 月 21–22 日｜Freiburg 周邊 Full-day Optional": "August 21–22 | Optional Full-Day Trips from Freiburg",
    "Freiburg City Walk 已安排在抵達日；以下選項可按天氣、興趣和體力挑選。每張卡片都是獨立 Full-day 行程，點擊後查看詳細時間軸、地圖、景點、餐廳和備案。": "The Freiburg city walk is scheduled for arrival day. Choose from the options below according to weather, interests, and energy. Each card is a self-contained full-day itinerary; open it for the timeline, map, sights, restaurants, and fallback plan.",
    "Black Forest／湖區、瀑布與自然": "Black Forest / Lakes, Waterfalls, and Nature",
    "差異重點：": "Best for:",
    "湖畔、森林及低強度散步，最適合慢節奏及天氣普通的一天。": "Lakeside scenery, forest, and easy walking—best for a relaxed day in fair but unexceptional weather.",
    "可搭配：湖上船程、湖畔咖啡、湖邊環線": "Combine with: a lake cruise, lakeside coffee, or the circular lakeside walk",
    "強度：低至中等｜天氣依賴：中": "Effort: low to moderate | Weather dependence: moderate",
