    "可搭配：Triberg Waterfalls、Black Forest Museum、景觀鐵路": "Combine with: Triberg Waterfalls, the Black Forest Museum, and the scenic railway",
    "強度：中等｜天氣依賴：中至高": "Effort: moderate | Weather dependence: moderate to high",
    "南黑森林瀑布、山谷和夏季戶外活動；只列 8 月可行的內容。": "Southern Black Forest waterfalls, valleys, and summer outdoor activities; only August options are included.",
    "可搭配：Todtnauer Wasserfall、Hasenhorn Coaster": "Combine with: Todtnauer Wasserfall and the Hasenhorn Coaster",
    "木骨架小鎮、河谷和博物館，最適合慢遊與地方文化。": "A half-timbered town, river valley, and museums—best for slow travel and local culture.",
    "可搭配：Old Town、Schüttesäge Museum、Kinzig 河岸": "Combine with: the Old Town, Schüttesäge Museum, and the Kinzig riverbank",
