    "溫泉、城市與主題樂園": "Spas, Cities, and Theme Parks",
    "溫泉、Kurhaus、公園及文化城市氛圍；雨天比森林步道更穩定。": "Thermal baths, the Kurhaus, parks, and a cultured city atmosphere; more reliable than forest trails in rain.",
    "可搭配：Thermal Spa、Kurhaus、Lichtentaler Allee": "Combine with: a thermal spa, the Kurhaus, and Lichtentaler Allee",
    "強度：低至中等｜天氣依賴：低至中": "Effort: low to moderate | Weather dependence: low to moderate",
