    "可搭配：Baumwipfelpfad、Sommerbergbahn、Palais Thermal": "Combine with: Baumwipfelpfad, Sommerbergbahn, and Palais Thermal",
    "獨立主題樂園日，不與黑森林自然景點混搭。": "A dedicated theme-park day; do not combine it with Black Forest nature sights.",
    "可搭配：主題分區、雲霄飛車、室內表演": "Combine with: themed areas, roller coasters, and indoor shows",
