    "Cross-border City／Basel 與 Alsace": "Cross-Border Cities / Basel and Alsace",
    "博物館、Rhine 河、Old Town 及跨境城市文化；作為自然日的雨天備案。": "Museums, the Rhine, the Old Town, and cross-border culture; a rainy-day fallback for a nature day.",
    "可搭配：Basel Minster、Kunstmuseum、Rhine riverside": "Combine with: Basel Minster, Kunstmuseum, and the Rhine riverfront",
