  Object.assign(window.travelEnglish.exact, {
    "Freiburg 當地美食：從 Münster 市集吃到 Baden 葡萄酒": "Freiburg Food: From the Münster Market to Baden Wine",
    "Freiburg 的味道來自三個空間：Münsterplatz 的市集小吃、Old Town 的 Baden 家常菜，以及 Black Forest 與葡萄園帶來的甜點、啤酒和葡萄酒。抵達日最實用的安排是一咸一甜；完整 City Walk 後再選啤酒花園或 Baden 晚餐。": "Freiburg’s flavours come from three settings: market snacks on Münsterplatz, Baden home cooking in the Old Town, and desserts, beer, and wine from the Black Forest and surrounding vineyards. On arrival day, the most practical tasting is one savoury item and one sweet; after the full city walk, choose either a beer garden or a Baden dinner.",
    "市集小吃": "Market snack",
    "約 35 釐米長、無腸衣的 Freiburg 烤豬肉香腸；外層焦香，傳統搭配炒洋蔥，麵包只負責托住香腸。": "A skinless Freiburg grilled pork sausage about 35 cm long, browned outside and traditionally served with fried onions; the bread is simply there to hold it.",
    "第一次可點 mit Zwiebeln；想照當地傳統就不要為了塞進麵包而切短。": "For your first one, order mit Zwiebeln. To follow local tradition, do not have it shortened just to fit the bread.",
    "Münsterplatz／Minster checkpoint": "Münsterplatz / Minster checkpoint",
    "一根足夠當輕午餐；兩人可先分享，再去吃甜點。": "One is enough for a light lunch; two people can share one before dessert.",
    "豬肉；素食版並非每個攤位都有。": "Contains pork; not every stall offers a vegetarian version.",
    "市集甜點": "Market dessert",
    "Freiburg 市集代表性的 quark cheesecake；使用少量蛋、cream 與 quark，口感輕柔，帶一點檸檬酸香。": "Freiburg market’s signature quark cheesecake, made with a little egg, cream, and quark for a light texture and gentle lemon tang.",
    "買一片現吃；比 Black Forest cake 更輕，適合步行中段。": "Buy one slice to eat immediately. It is lighter than Black Forest cake and works well midway through the walk.",
    "Münsterplatz，與 Lange Rote 前後搭配": "Münsterplatz, before or after a Lange Rote",
    "兩人分一片即可繼續走路。": "Share one slice between two people so you can keep walking comfortably.",
    "含奶、蛋和麩質。": "Contains dairy, egg, and gluten.",
    "Baden 家常菜": "Baden home cooking",
    "香草 quark 鮮奶酪配煎馬鈴薯，是南 Baden 啤酒花園常見的清爽組合。": "Herbed quark with fried potatoes, a fresh, light combination common in southern Baden beer gardens.",
    "先吃原味，再按需要加鹽、胡椒或洋蔥；比肉類主菜更適合夏天。": "Taste it first, then add salt, pepper, or onion as needed. It suits summer better than a heavy meat dish.",
    "Schwabentor 後的午餐／啤酒花園": "Lunch / beer garden after Schwabentor",
    "可作一人輕主餐，也適合兩人共享配沙拉。": "Works as a light main for one or shared by two with a salad.",
    "奶製品；通常為素食，仍應確認煎薯用油。": "Contains dairy; usually vegetarian, but confirm what fat is used for the potatoes.",
    "薄餅／共享": "Flatbread / sharing",
    "薄脆面餅抹 crème fraîche，經典版本加洋蔥和培根；靠近 Alsace 的 Freiburg 很常見。": "A thin, crisp flatbread spread with crème fraîche; the classic version adds onion and bacon. It is common in Freiburg because of the city’s proximity to Alsace.",
    "趁熱分食，邊緣應脆而不是厚軟；可找 vegetarian 版本。": "Share it hot; the edges should be crisp, not thick and soft. Vegetarian versions are often available.",
    "Old Town 晚餐或 Schlossberg 觀景休息": "Old Town dinner or Schlossberg viewpoint break",
    "一張適合兩人共享，再加 salad。": "One is suitable for two people to share with a salad.",
    "含奶和麩質；經典版含豬肉。": "Contains dairy and gluten; the classic version contains pork.",
    "Black Forest 甜點": "Black Forest dessert",
    "巧克力蛋糕、鮮奶油、櫻桃與 Kirsch 櫻桃酒組成的 Black Forest cake；重點是酒香與酸甜平衡。": "Black Forest cake made with chocolate sponge, whipped cream, cherries, and Kirsch; the key is the balance of cherry spirit, sweetness, and acidity.",
    "在 café 點單片並配黑咖啡，不要在高溫下長時間攜帶。": "Order a single slice in a café with black coffee; do not carry it for long in hot weather.",
    "下午茶，或 Black Forest day trip 再吃": "Afternoon coffee, or save it for a Black Forest day trip",
    "奶油厚重，兩人分享一片較舒服。": "The cream is rich, so sharing one slice between two is more comfortable.",
    "含奶、蛋、麩質與酒精。": "Contains dairy, egg, gluten, and alcohol.",
    "本地飲品": "Local drink",
    "Freiburg 有 Ganter、Feierling 及 craft breweries；Feierling 的自然渾濁 Inselhopf 是 Old Town 很容易體驗的一杯。": "Freiburg has Ganter, Feierling, and several craft breweries. Feierling’s naturally cloudy Inselhopf is an easy local beer to try in the Old Town.",
    "先點小杯判斷風格；酒後不要接陡坡或需要精確轉乘的行程。": "Start with a small glass to judge the style. Do not follow alcohol with a steep climb or a time-critical connection.",
    "Schwabentor／Schneckenvorstadt 晚餐段": "Dinner around Schwabentor / Schneckenvorstadt",
    "一杯配 Bibeleskäs 或 pretzel 即可。": "One glass with Bibeleskäs or a pretzel is enough.",
    "含酒精和通常含麩質；可問 alcohol-free beer。": "Contains alcohol and usually gluten; ask for alcohol-free beer if needed.",
    "葡萄酒文化": "Wine culture",
    "Freiburg 周圍交會 Breisgau、Markgräflerland 與 Tuniberg 產區；Gutedel、Pinot Gris 與 Pinot Noir 都比籠統點“德國白酒”更有地方性。": "Around Freiburg, the Breisgau, Markgräflerland, and Tuniberg wine regions meet. Gutedel, Pinot Gris, and Pinot Noir all offer more local character than ordering a generic ‘German white wine.’",
    "夏天先試一杯乾型 Gutedel 或 Pinot Gris；不必為了品酒一次點多款。": "In summer, start with one glass of dry Gutedel or Pinot Gris; there is no need to order several wines at once for a tasting.",
    "Münsterplatz Alte Wache，或正式晚餐": "Alte Wache on Münsterplatz, or with a proper dinner",
    "一杯即可；若當天跨城或上坡則選無酒精飲料。": "One glass is enough; choose a non-alcoholic drink on a transfer or hill-walking day.",
    "含酒精與 sulfites。": "Contains alcohol and sulfites.",
    "抵達後先放行李；此段只補水，不急著在車站吃完整正餐。": "Leave your luggage first. On this leg, just refill water rather than rushing into a full meal at the station.",
    "市集開放時選 Lange Rote + 一片 Käsekuchen；兩人共享就是高效率的 Freiburg tasting。": "When the market is open, choose a Lange Rote plus one slice of Käsekuchen. Sharing both is an efficient Freiburg tasting for two.",
    "想坐下休息，可選 Bibeleskäs mit Brägele 或 Flammkuchen，避免同時再點厚重肉菜。": "For a seated break, choose Bibeleskäs mit Brägele or Flammkuchen and avoid adding another heavy meat dish.",
    "體力與天氣允許再選一杯 Freiburg beer 或 Baden wine；飲酒後不走濕滑山徑。": "If energy and weather allow, add one Freiburg beer or glass of Baden wine. Do not walk a wet hillside trail after drinking.",
    "遇到 Münstermarkt 時": "When Münstermarkt Is Open",
    "Münstermarkt 通常每週一至六圍繞 Freiburg Minster 營業，攤位與節假日安排會調整。Lange Rote 與 Käsekuchen 應優先放在市集時段；星期日抵達則改用 café、bakery 或 Old Town restaurant。": "Münstermarkt normally operates around Freiburg Minster Monday–Saturday, though stalls and public-holiday arrangements vary. Prioritise Lange Rote and Käsekuchen during market hours; for a Sunday arrival, use a café, bakery, or Old Town restaurant instead.",

    "Frankfurt 七種代表味道：市場午餐、綠色醬與 Apfelwein 文化": "Seven Essential Frankfurt Flavours: Market Lunch, Green Sauce, and Apfelwein Culture",
    "Frankfurt 的地方味道非常集中：Kleinmarkthalle 適合白天小吃，Sachsenhausen 適合晚上的 Apfelwein tavern。七種官方代表食物不必全部吃齊；最好的組合是一份冷食／小吃、一份主菜和一種甜點。": "Frankfurt’s local flavours are easy to locate: Kleinmarkthalle is best for daytime snacks, while Sachsenhausen suits an evening Apfelwein tavern. There is no need to try all seven official specialities; the best combination is one cold dish or snack, one main, and one sweet.",
    "城市飲品": "City drink",
    "偏酸、清爽的發酵蘋果酒，傳統從灰藍色 Bembel 陶壺倒進有菱格紋的 Geripptes 玻璃杯。": "A tart, refreshing fermented apple wine, traditionally poured from a grey-blue Bembel jug into a diamond-patterned Geripptes glass.",
    "先點一杯純飲；怕酸可選加礦泉水的 Sauergespritzter。": "Try one glass straight first. If the acidity worries you, order a Sauergespritzter mixed with sparkling water.",
    "Sachsenhausen 晚餐段": "Sachsenhausen dinner stop",
    "一杯體驗即可；返程日不喝酒。": "One glass is enough for the experience; do not drink on departure day.",
    "含酒精與可能含 sulfites。": "Contains alcohol and may contain sulfites.",
    "冷醬／輕主餐": "Cold sauce / light main",
    "由七種香草製成、冷食的綠色醬，經典搭配水煮蛋和馬鈴薯，也會配 schnitzel 或魚。": "A cold green sauce made with seven herbs, classically served with boiled eggs and potatoes, or sometimes with schnitzel or fish.",
    "第一次選 egg + potato 版本，最能吃出香草本身。": "For your first taste, choose the egg-and-potato version so the herbs remain the focus.",
    "Kleinmarkthalle／Old Town 午餐": "Kleinmarkthalle / Old Town lunch",
    "比 Rippchen 輕，適合 City Walk 中段。": "Lighter than Rippchen and well suited to the middle of the city walk.",
    "蛋奶配方依店家；基礎版本通常可素食。": "Egg and dairy ingredients vary by kitchen; the basic version is usually vegetarian.",
    "酒館冷食": "Cold tavern dish",
    "低脂酸奶酪以醋、油、洋蔥和香料醃制；“mit Musik”幽默地指洋蔥之後的生理效果。": "Low-fat sour-milk cheese marinated with vinegar, oil, onion, and spices. ‘Mit Musik’ jokingly refers to the onions’ later digestive effect.",
    "用叉子配麵包吃；氣味和酸味明顯，先點一份共享。": "Eat it with a fork and bread. The aroma and acidity are pronounced, so share one portion first.",
    "Apfelwein tavern 前菜": "Starter at an Apfelwein tavern",
    "兩人分食最合適。": "Best shared by two.",
    "奶製品；醃汁與麵包成分另問。": "Contains dairy; ask separately about the marinade and bread ingredients.",
    "快速小吃": "Quick snack",
    "細長、輕煙薰的豬肉香腸，傳統以熱水加熱而不是大火煎烤，配麵包和 mustard。": "A slender, lightly smoked pork sausage, traditionally warmed in hot water rather than fried over high heat and served with bread and mustard.",
    "把它當市場小吃，不需要為了“正宗”點成複雜套餐。": "Treat it as a market snack; there is no need to order an elaborate set meal for ‘authenticity.’",
    "Kleinmarkthalle／City Walk 中段": "Kleinmarkthalle / midway through the city walk",
    "一對可當輕午餐，兩人也可共享試味。": "A pair makes a light lunch, or two people can share it as a tasting.",
    "豬肉；mustard 與麵包過敏者留意。": "Contains pork; check mustard and bread if you have allergies.",
    "傳統重菜": "Hearty traditional dish",
    "醃制豬排配酸菜和馬鈴薯，是比 sausage 更完整、更厚重的 Frankfurt 酒館主菜。": "Cured pork chop with sauerkraut and potatoes, a fuller and heavier Frankfurt tavern main than sausage.",
    "留給 City Walk 結束後；配 Apfelwein 時減少其他肉食。": "Save it for after the city walk; if pairing it with Apfelwein, order less additional meat.",
    "Sachsenhausen 晚餐": "Dinner in Sachsenhausen",
    "一人份很飽，先確認是否適合分享。": "A single portion is very filling; ask whether it can be shared.",
    "豬肉、高鹽；不適合返程前輕食。": "Contains pork and is high in salt; unsuitable as a light meal before departure.",
    "蛋糕／下午茶": "Cake / afternoon coffee",
    "環形 sponge cake 夾 buttercream 與果醬，外層裹脆果仁，外觀象徵 Frankfurt 的“皇冠”。": "A ring-shaped sponge layered with buttercream and jam and coated in crunchy nuts; its appearance symbolises Frankfurt’s ‘crown.’",
    "點單片配咖啡；奶油怕熱，不適合裝進夏季行李。": "Order one slice with coffee. The buttercream does not travel well in hot summer luggage.",
    "Old Town café 下午茶": "Afternoon coffee in an Old Town café",
    "兩人分享一片較舒服。": "One slice is more comfortable shared by two.",
    "含奶、蛋、麩質和堅果。": "Contains dairy, egg, gluten, and nuts.",
    "甜點／手信": "Sweet / souvenir",
    "小型杏仁膏烘焙甜點，外側以杏仁裝飾，與 Frankfurt 的 Bethmann family 故事相連。": "A small baked marzipan sweet decorated with almonds and linked to the story of Frankfurt’s Bethmann family.",
    "先買兩三顆試味；比奶油蛋糕更適合帶往機場。": "Buy two or three to taste first. They travel to the airport better than buttercream cake.",
    "Kleinmarkthalle、bakery 或返程伴手禮": "Kleinmarkthalle, a bakery, or a departure-day souvenir",
    "體積小但甜度高，一次一顆。": "Small but very sweet; have one at a time.",
    "含杏仁、蛋；配方可能含 gluten。": "Contains almonds and egg; the recipe may contain gluten.",
    "星期六先吃 Grüne Soße、Frankfurter Würstchen 或小份市場食物；不要一開始就吃 Rippchen。": "On Saturday, start with Grüne Soße, Frankfurter Würstchen, or a small market snack; do not begin with Rippchen.",
    "途中安排 Bethmännchen 或一片 Frankfurter Kranz；奶油蛋糕現場吃，不放行李。": "Have a Bethmännchen or slice of Frankfurter Kranz en route. Eat the buttercream cake on the spot rather than packing it.",
    "想體驗酒館文化，點一杯 Apfelwein + 一份 Handkäs；對酸味沒把握就兩人共享。": "For tavern culture, order one glass of Apfelwein plus one Handkäs. If unsure about the acidity, share between two.",
    "City Walk 結束／機場日": "End of the city walk / airport day",
    "Rippchen 只放在星期六晚餐；星期日返程保留輕食，並用 Bethmännchen 作可攜帶手信。": "Keep Rippchen for Saturday dinner. Eat lightly before Sunday’s departure, using Bethmännchen as a portable souvenir.",
    "本行程的星期規則": "Day-of-Week Rules for This Itinerary",
    "Kleinmarkthalle 星期六適合作為路線開場，星期日休息。Museumsuferfest 週末的橋梁、河岸和 Sachsenhausen 會擁擠，想吃 Apfelwein tavern 應預留排隊與過橋時間；返程日不以排隊名店為目標。": "Kleinmarkthalle is a good Saturday start and closes on Sunday. During Museumsuferfest, bridges, the riverfront, and Sachsenhausen will be crowded; allow time to queue and cross the river if visiting an Apfelwein tavern. On departure day, do not target famous places with long queues."
  });

