    "Freiburg (Breisgau) Hbf → Heidelberg Hbf；以 direct ICE 或最少轉乘為優先，兩件大行李不安排中途停留。": "Freiburg (Breisgau) Hbf → Heidelberg Hbf: prioritise a direct ICE or the fewest possible changes. With two large bags, do not plan a stop en route.",
    "到住宿放行李、午餐與休息。Heidelberg Hbf → Bismarckplatz 約 10 分鐘 tram / bus；不要拖行李走入 Old Town 石板街。": "Leave your bags at the accommodation, have lunch, and rest. Heidelberg Hbf → Bismarckplatz takes about 10 minutes by tram or bus; do not drag luggage over the Old Town's cobbled streets.",
