    "一般本地日可考慮 Heidelberg city day ticket（成人 €9.30、至翌日 03:00）；只走 Old Town 時不必買 day pass。": "For a local sightseeing day, consider a Heidelberg city day ticket (adult €9.30, valid until 03:00 the next day). You do not need a day pass if you are only walking through the Old Town.",
    "HeidelbergCARD 何時值得": "When the HeidelbergCARD Pays Off",
    "1 / 2 / 4 日 €25 / €36 / €40，含 VRN、Castle ticket / lower funicular 和 University combo ticket。只有同一段期間同時搭車、參觀 Castle 及 University Museum / Student Prison 才值得計算。": "The 1-, 2-, and 4-day cards cost €25, €36, and €40 and include VRN transport, a castle ticket / lower funicular, and a university combination ticket. It is worth considering only when you will use transport and visit both the castle and the University Museum / Student Prison within the same validity period.",
    "卡為個人化實體票，castle component 須領取；不能把它當作所有 day trip 的 Germany pass。": "This is a personalised physical card, and the castle component must be collected. It is not a Germany-wide pass for every day trip.",
    "這條路線由現代交通入口走進大學城與 German Romanticism 的歷史核心，最後在 Neckar 河上理解 Old Town、Castle 和 Philosophenweg 三者的關係。Castle 與山坡為獨立 Option，不硬塞到抵達日。": "This route leads from the modern transport gateway into the historic heart of the university town and German Romanticism. It ends over the Neckar, where the relationship between the Old Town, castle, and Philosophenweg becomes clear. Treat the castle and hillsides as separate options rather than squeezing them into arrival day.",
    "地圖藍線按 OSM walking route 計算；主線約 2–3 公里、2–3 小時。Old Bridge 是自然終點；回 Bismarckplatz 可沿河步行或搭公共交通，不需原路折返。": "The blue line follows an OSM walking route; the main route is about 2–3 km and takes 2–3 hours. The Old Bridge is the natural finish. Return to Bismarckplatz along the river or by public transport instead of retracing the route.",
    "餐廳／甜點 Optional": "Optional restaurant / dessert",
    "具體餐廳落點": "Specific Food Stops",
    "Hackteufel｜Old Bridge 附近": "Hackteufel | Near the Old Bridge",
    "Maultaschen、Saumagen 與 hand-scraped Spätzle；適合 City Walk 終點正餐。營業時間和休息日臨行以餐廳官網為準。": "Maultaschen, Saumagen, and hand-scraped Spätzle; a good full meal at the end of the city walk. Check the restaurant's website shortly before the visit for opening hours and closing days.",
    "Schnitzelbank｜Old Town 晚餐": "Schnitzelbank | Old Town Dinner",
    "Saumagen、Leberknödel、Schnitzel 與 Käsespätzle；座位少，晚餐建議訂位並確認當日營業。": "Saumagen, Leberknödel, Schnitzel, and Käsespätzle. Seating is limited, so reserve for dinner and confirm that it is open that day.",
    "Café Knösel｜固定甜點 checkpoint": "Café Knösel | Planned Dessert Stop",
    "位於 Haspelgasse、距 Heiliggeistkirche 很近；Studentenkuss 適合現場吃一個，再決定是否買作手信。": "On Haspelgasse, very close to Heiliggeistkirche. Try one Studentenkuss on the spot before deciding whether to buy a box as a souvenir.",
    "2026 August｜開放與限制": "August 2026 | Opening Hours and Restrictions",
    "Castle 每日 09:00–18:00、最後入場 17:30；adult €11 含 courtyard、Great Barrel、Pharmacy Museum 及 lower funicular return。Kornmarkt–Castle 每 10 分鐘，Königstuhl upper line 每 20 分鐘；upper line 非無障礙。": "The castle is open daily 09:00–18:00, with last admission at 17:30. The €11 adult ticket includes the courtyard, Great Barrel, Pharmacy Museum, and a return trip on the lower funicular. Kornmarkt–Castle runs every 10 minutes and the upper line to Königstuhl every 20 minutes; the upper line is not accessible.",
    "University Museum 夏季週二至日 10:00–18:00、週一閉館。Student Prison 夏季每日 10:00–18:00、13:45–14:15 暫停；需 locker、€1 coin，樓梯限制多，建議預約。": "The University Museum is open Tuesday–Sunday 10:00–18:00 in summer and closed Monday. The Student Prison is open daily 10:00–18:00 in summer, with a pause from 13:45–14:15. A locker and €1 coin are required; there are many stairs, and booking is recommended.",
    "山坡工程": "Hillside Construction",
    "Graimbergweg 2026 年底前關閉，Castle / Molkenkur 周邊步行動線可能受影響；一週前再查官方 construction map。8/24 Castle + Philosophenweg 遇雷雨則改 Old Town 室內。": "Graimbergweg is closed through the end of 2026, which may affect walking routes around the castle and Molkenkur. Recheck the official construction map one week beforehand. If thunderstorms are forecast on August 24, replace the castle + Philosophenweg plan with indoor Old Town sights.",
    "Heidelberg 周邊位置總覽": "Heidelberg and Surroundings at a Glance",
    "先看 Heidelberg 與周邊的相對位置，再按天氣、體力和交通選擇一個獨立 Full-day。連線只表示地理方向，不代表實際鐵路路線。": "First check the relative positions of Heidelberg and the surrounding destinations, then choose one self-contained full-day trip based on weather, energy, and transport. The connecting lines show direction only, not actual rail routes.",
    "Heidelberg 基地": "Heidelberg base",
    "Local／自然": "Local / nature",
    "花園／跨境／Wellness": "Garden / cross-border / wellness",
    "點擊標記可查看目的地主題；詳細交通請按獨立行程頁面確認。": "Select a marker to see the destination theme; use the dedicated itinerary page for detailed transport guidance.",
    "Heidelberg 不再只有抵達日下午的短線；以下三個方案可按日期和天氣獨立選一天。": "Heidelberg is not limited to a short arrival-afternoon walk. Each of the following three plans can fill a separate day, chosen to suit the date and weather.",
    "主街、大學廣場、Heiliggeistkirche、Marktplatz 和 Old Bridge；最適合抵達後或低強度城市日。": "Hauptstraße, Universitätsplatz, Heiliggeistkirche, Marktplatz, and the Old Bridge; best after arrival or for an easy city day.",
    "城堡、funicular、Old Bridge 和山坡觀景；坡度較多，留給晴天和體力較好的日子。": "The castle, funicular, Old Bridge, and hillside viewpoints. With several climbs, save this for clear weather and a higher-energy day.",
    "把河岸、高地和森林拆成彈性自然日；高地遇雷雨時改為室內文化和河岸短走。": "Combine the riverbank, uplands, and forest as a flexible nature day. If thunderstorms threaten the heights, switch to indoor cultural sights and a short riverside walk.",
