    "Rhine 城市文化｜Speyer": "Rhine City Culture | Speyer",
    "Cathedral、Maximilianstraße、Historical Museum 和 Rhine promenade。": "Cathedral, Maximilianstraße, Historical Museum, and the Rhine promenade.",
    "Cathedral、Petite France、Barrage Vauban；不與 Freiburg 版交通路線混用。": "Cathedral, Petite France, and Barrage Vauban; do not mix this with the transport plan from the Freiburg version.",
