    "Slow／室內": "Slow / indoors",
    "Kurpfälzisches Museum、Student Prison、Neckar 河岸；適合雨天和整理行李。": "Kurpfälzisches Museum, the Student Prison, and the Neckar riverbank; suitable for rain or a day when you need time to pack.",
    "日期建議與交通安排": "Suggested Dates and Transport Plan",
    "8 月 23 日（日）｜抵達 Heidelberg": "Sunday, August 23 | Arrive in Heidelberg",
    "Freiburg → Heidelberg 後先放置行李；若有體力，選": "After travelling from Freiburg to Heidelberg, leave your luggage first. If you still have energy, take the short version of",
    "的短版，不安排 Schloss 山坡。": "; do not add the Schloss hillside.",
    "8 月 24–28 日｜五個 Full-day 彈性選擇": "August 24–28 | Five Flexible Full-Day Choices",
    "建議安排 Castle、Speyer、Strasbourg、Schwetzingen／Mannheim 及一個自然或恢復日；Cologne、Baden-Baden、Colmar 作替補，不必全部完成。": "Prioritise the castle, Speyer, Strasbourg, Schwetzingen or Mannheim, and one nature or recovery day. Keep Cologne, Baden-Baden, and Colmar as substitutes; there is no need to do them all.",
    "8 月 29 日｜Heidelberg → Frankfurt": "August 29 | Heidelberg → Frankfurt",
    "保留轉移緩衝，不安排 Cologne 或跨境長途行程；上午只做住宿附近短線。": "Keep a buffer for the transfer and do not schedule Cologne or a long cross-border trip. Take only a short walk near the accommodation in the morning.",
    "抵達 Heidelberg Hbf 後，不建議拖大型行李一路步行至 Old Town；乘 tram / bus 到 Bismarckplatz 約 10 分鐘。": "After reaching Heidelberg Hbf, do not drag large luggage all the way to the Old Town. Take a tram or bus to Bismarckplatz in about 10 minutes.",
    "跨城日出發前確認 DB／跨境車次、票券、行李和回程緩衝；Cologne 與 Strasbourg 不再疊加其他目的地。": "Before an intercity day, confirm DB or cross-border services, tickets, luggage arrangements, and the return buffer. Do not add another destination to Cologne or Strasbourg.",
    "大型行李留在 Heidelberg 基地；8/29 只做基地至 Frankfurt 的轉移。": "Leave the large luggage at your Heidelberg base; on August 29, make only the transfer from Heidelberg to Frankfurt.",
    "Heidelberg 備案與離開日": "Heidelberg Fallbacks and Departure Day",
