    "University Museum（週二至日）、Student Prison、Kurpfälzisches Museum 和 café；週一勿把 University Museum 放進計畫。": "University Museum (Tuesday–Sunday), Student Prison, Kurpfälzisches Museum, and a café. Do not include the University Museum on Monday.",
    "體力不足": "Low energy",
    "只走 Old Town 主線，Castle 由 funicular 上下；不把 Philosophenweg、Heiligenberg、Königstuhl 疊在同日。": "Walk only the main Old Town route and use the funicular both ways for the castle. Do not combine Philosophenweg, Heiligenberg, and Königstuhl on the same day.",
    "8/29 轉移 Frankfurt": "August 29 Transfer to Frankfurt",
    "上午只做住宿附近短線；確認 DB 班次後直達 Frankfurt (Main) Hbf。不要安排 Cologne、Strasbourg 或跨境行程。": "Take only a short walk near the accommodation in the morning, then confirm the DB service and travel directly to Frankfurt (Main) Hbf. Do not schedule Cologne, Strasbourg, or any cross-border trip.",
    "Heidelberg 歷史、文化與空間理解": "Understanding Heidelberg's History, Culture, and Layout",
    "Heidelberg 的核心是 Neckar River 南岸的狹長 Old Town：大學、Hauptstraße 和 Market Square 沿河谷延伸；Castle 位於南側坡地，Philosophenweg / Heiligenberg 位於北岸高地。這種「河谷 + 兩側山坡」讓它成為 German Romanticism 的代表城市，而不是單一城堡景點。": "Heidelberg's core is the long, narrow Old Town on the south bank of the Neckar. The university, Hauptstraße, and Market Square extend along the river valley; the castle occupies the southern slope, while Philosophenweg and Heiligenberg rise on the north bank. This valley-and-two-hillsides setting makes Heidelberg an emblematic city of German Romanticism, not simply a single castle sight.",
    "現代交通入口與 Old Town 西端。": "The modern transport gateway and western edge of the Old Town.",
    "學術生活、教堂、主街和市民空間的核心。": "The heart of academic life, churches, the main street, and civic space.",
    "由 Kornmarkt funicular 連接，適合作獨立半日。": "Reached by the Kornmarkt funicular and best treated as a separate half-day.",
    "Old Bridge 連接河岸與北側高地，是理解城市景觀的最佳對照。": "The Old Bridge connects the riverbanks and the northern heights, offering the clearest view of Heidelberg's urban landscape.",
    "｜路線：Heidelberg → Frankfurt｜下一站：": "| Route: Heidelberg → Frankfurt | Next stop:",
